# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .gitignore for the vouchfx .NET 8 LTS solution
# Covers: .NET build output, Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code, NuGet, test
# results, the (TypeScript) VS Code extension, local secrets, and OS cruft.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

## .NET build output
bin/
obj/
out/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
[Bb]uilds/
artifacts/
publish/
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json

## .NET tool / restore caches
.dotnet/
.packages/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets

## NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
.nuget/
packages/
!**/packages/build/
## Local `dotnet pack` output (S08 T4)
_nupkg/

## Test results & coverage
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coverletoutput
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info
TestResults/

## Visual Studio
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.sln.docstates
*.userosscache
*.vspscc
*.vssscc
*_i.c
*_p.c
*_h.h

## Rider / JetBrains
.idea/
*.sln.iml

## Visual Studio Code (keep shared workspace config, ignore the rest)
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.code-workspace

## VS Code extension (TypeScript / Node)
node_modules/
*.vsix
dist/
.eslintcache
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

## Roslyn / MSBuild
*.binlog
msbuild.log
msbuild.err
msbuild.wrn

## Local secrets & environment (the DSL resolves ${secret:file/...} from
## git-ignored files by convention — never commit resolved credentials)
*.secrets
secrets.json
secrets.local.*
*.local.secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
appsettings.*.local.json

## Testcontainers / Docker scratch
.testcontainers.properties

## OS-generated files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

## Logs & temp
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
*~

# Custom
.claude/
.serena/
.vscode/
.rider/

# Generated GitHub Pages output (built by scripts/build_site.py)
_site/
_site_*/

## Python (scripts/site-tools shared site generator)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
scripts/site-tools/build/

# Maintainer-local delivery/planning material — deliberately not published
# (internal: sprint plans, commercial planning, human-only checklists, review evidence)
/plan/
/HUMAN_TODO.md
/docs/03_MVP_Project_Plan.md
/docs/reviews/
